[I] Fast and lightweight GIF encoder written in C

[T] CGIF is a fast and lightweight GIF encoder written in C99 that can
[T] create GIF images and animations. It supports global or local color
[T] palettes with up to 256 colors, size optimizations for animations via
[T] transparency and changed-area encoding, and per-frame delays; it is used
[T] by libvips.

[U] https://github.com/dloebl/cgif

